WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.356
Step 2. Change the identifiers of a registered patient.

1.2
00:00:04.356 --> 00:00:10.104
In General Info, select Edit. The form shows the deployment-wide identifiers.

1.3
00:00:10.104 --> 00:00:14.784
Change a value or fill an empty one, then select Update.

2.1
00:00:14.784 --> 00:00:17.980
Step 4. See the patient's identifiers.

2.2
00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:24.683
The Identifiers section shows each identifier's name and value, and has no Edit.
